This PR exposes the `FULL_BW` parameter of the `axi_to_axi_lite` module in the `axi_to_reg` IP. This enables AXI testbench memories built on `axi_to_reg` to have full bandwidth, i.e. respond with a maximum throughput of one R beat every cycle.

Depends on [this PR](https://github.com/pulp-platform/axi/pull/307), so **wait for it to be merged first and update Bender dependency**.
